  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9d9f235a53f95caef12c67110012e93f1bf37871.png\" alt=\"農夫樂園 Excalibur 標題\"></p><p>這是一個<strong>資源包</strong>，旨在讓<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫樂園</a>模組的視覺風格與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur</a>資源包相互搭配。此資源包已完成度為 100%，包含 411 種物品與方塊的紋理。</p><h2>安裝方式：</h2><p>&gt; 啟動 Minecraft 並點選「選項」</p><p>&gt; 點選「資源包」</p><p>&gt; 點選「打開資源包資料夾」</p><p>&gt; 將 FarmersDelightExcaliburSupport.zip 檔案拖曳至資源包資料夾中</p><p>&gt; 將「農夫樂園 Excalibur 支援包」從左側欄位移動至右側</p><p>&gt; 確保支援包位於原始 Excalibur 資源包之上</p><p>&gt; 選擇「完成」</p><p>&gt; 開始務農吧！</p><h2>紋理與方塊展示</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b3efcecbc0ac51846ee4e0c8434f507ec34d9d91.png\" alt=\"食物方塊展示\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/38ad14e8e5c28ba2ab5eebdf8cd89c5c81928bb3.png\" alt=\"植物展示\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/af02ea875dcffaf697eb54f0e479bbc8d8e45deb.png\" alt=\"方塊展示\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0cada57720591e4128d0d1ee89be5647641c9832.png\" alt=\"食物物品展示\"></p>",
